      "primaryDisplayName": "Hearts",
      "description": "The suit of Hearts in a standard playing card deck. Corresponds to the tarot suit of Cups and the element of Water. Associated with love, emotion, relationships, intuition, and domestic life. In cartomancy Hearts are the most positive suit, relating to feelings, home, and happiness.",
