      "description": "The suit of Clubs in a standard playing card deck. Corresponds to the tarot suit of Wands and the element of Fire. Associated with energy, ambition, career, creativity, and enterprise. The club symbol derives from the trefoil clover (trèfle in French). In cartomancy Clubs represent work, passion, and dynamic activity.",
